{"parse": {"title": "漫漫之夜行迹-10", "pageid": 56399, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-09\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">漫漫之夜行迹-10</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B5.B7.E9.9D.A2.E4.BB.A5.E4.B8.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"海面以下\">海面以下</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 海面以下</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自从母亲去世的那个晚上，我便再没有踏入她的墓地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>命运以如此实际的面貌呈现在面前时，实在让人感到不适。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_6caodi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_6caodi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_6caodi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-1_4_bg_6caodi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_6caodi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-1_4_bg_6caodi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_6caodi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-1_4_bg_6caodi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_6caodi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那时候，突发奇想地，我决定来到这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像蒙受一种启示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……艾尔玛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她理应在为出航的事操劳，此刻却静默地独立于草地上，就像一座活着的墓碑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她瞧见我，却并不惊讶，仿佛早已知晓命运的安排。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>亚齐，我的孩子，你来得正好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>我知道你一直心存疑虑，我们相连的血脉反而增加了这种隔阂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>你试图以知识对抗“启示”，可那也令你愈发疑惑。你会迷失在思绪的迷宫中，找不到脱逃的红色线头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……这些话我已经听过了，艾尔玛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她微笑着摇了摇头，拿出一本硬质的书籍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>我想你会需要这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>午安，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我听见她的脚步声消失在树影之后，如一滴露水从树叶上滑落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低下头，我看见了这本书籍的名称。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>《来自于天上的声音》……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一册儿童绘本，岛上的每个孩子都熟悉它，讨论过它，甚至因它发生过争执。<br />无需阅读书页，它也在我的脑中清晰可见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>天上的声音如是说，有件大事将要发生在你身上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>于是，他终其一生地等待一个奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>直至死亡到来，一切仍未发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>那人缠绵病榻时，又对天上的声音询问，那件大事在何时发生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>天上的声音说：“我曾予以你无数创造奇迹的机会，可你都错失了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>“因为你自以为知晓了命运，于是不再采取任何行动。最终，一事无成。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我曾憎恶过这个故事，因为它将天上的意志包装为某种趋之若鹜的好处，对命运的冷酷只字未提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但撇去所有误解，它的寓意是如此简单：不要一味等待，需主动去承担自己的天命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——这是我早就知道的事，也是我已经做出的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……这本书里，究竟还有什么我需要的内容呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当我意识到，自己已踱步来到沙滩时，天已经黑了下来。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>之后的日子十分平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信仰者们带着对真理和知识的渴求，出海探索那个变动不安的现象世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船归航的时间却远远地超出了预料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅰ：</div><div>不……不可能，这已经是最大的偏差可能性了，无论如何，今天他们一定回来才对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅰ：</div><div>只要他们还活着，还能坐上船，就不可能回不到岛上来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们日以继夜地等待在海岸旁，渴盼着领袖与船舶的归来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很快，他们开始越来越恐慌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>嘿——看那，那是船！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到有一个人振臂而呼，高高地跳起，带来喜悦的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅰ：</div><div>太好了，我就知道他们没事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>太好了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远航的船沿照既定的航线归来，角度与时速都毫无偏差。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们跑向海岸，等待着迎接来自于外界的新知卓见，他们相信，那些前所未有的想法一定能在真理的道路上引领光辉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-511010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>爸爸——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐真诚的朋友也在其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-511014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“流溢”是在他们面前降临的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人不在呼唤，无人不在喧闹。他们嘶吼、哭喊、跌倒在沙地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不祥的喧闹也传到了那个有顶的房间内。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_61.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_61\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_61\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/Cg-1_4_at_61.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_61.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/Cg-1_4_at_61.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_61.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/Cg-1_4_at_61.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_61.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/HeadIconSmall-307912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/HeadIconSmall-307912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/HeadIconSmall-307912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐罔顾颤抖的手指，拿下了书本，将它在桌上摊开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无论最坏的结果是否发生，这都是他本来预计要做的事。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_6kanshu1\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_6kanshu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……天上的声音如是说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>有件大事将要发生在你身上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_6kanshu2\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_6kanshu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>那人便开口问了，那是什么样的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>天上的声音回答，你将变得富足美满，拥有智慧与声名……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朗读的声音停止了。他的手指停在书页之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与此同时，一个几何体被冲刷到了岸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一个漂亮的三棱锥，金色的荧光如同艾尔玛仍在康健时期的美丽金发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——“启示”叩响了门扉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数古老的知识，顺着灵魂数字6的烙印传递而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道德的，历史的，经验的，抽象的，数理的，人文的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是学派领袖代代相传的智慧结晶，窥见真理之人通过血脉传下的奥妙一隅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>启示，知识，智慧——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们如此汹涌而浩瀚，凡人的一生所得与所思所想和它们相比，就如大海之于水瓶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>命运的巨石已然落下，新的6诞生了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_6kanshu3\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_6kanshu3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu3.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu3.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu3.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanshu3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>礁岩仍未改变分毫，它早已在长夜的磨砺中变得足够坚硬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>停驻的手轻轻落下，将那页揭过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>“启示”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">6：</div><div>……原来，不过如此而已。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "漫漫之夜行迹-10"}}